  message: "Fixed in PR #2298 (merged to dev 308a326ad), commit 'fix(sketch): an imported README keeps its description; explain holds back': explain now holds back the source of every agent instruction file. LIVE REPRO on dev after the merge: hypergumbo explain AGENTS.md /tmp/pr4_fx/agentfiles --first -> exit 0, 0 SENTINEL lines in stdout, prints '[Source held back: AGENTS.md is an agent instruction file (OpenAI Codex, GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Amp; imported by CLAUDE.md)]'. Before: the whole file was printed. Tests: test_sketch_agent_instructions.py (test_an_imported_readme_is_not_printed_by_explain, test_explain_holds_back_instruction_file_sources_of_callers_and_callees)."  # 984d
